      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not sure if this requires a fix or more documentation as I know some worlds deliberatly add damage to everyone.  Like that shooting world where a nuke goes off and kills everyone on the map, etc.  Perhaps having it default to Local would be a good idea or add more info/warnings to the tooltips in the SDK.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
